{"version":1,"content":"<p>開源加密軟件庫OpenSSL於2026年10月23日正式發佈4.1版本。此次更新引入多項新功能與性能優化，包括支持DTLS 1.3協議、實現GREASE機制、加速後量子密碼算法，並針對支持AVX-512指令集的x86-64處理器優化部分加密運算。此外，新版本還移除了對Windows CE和Windows安騰平台的構建支持，進一步清理歷史遺留代碼。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583604.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T16:24:54.659594+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":179,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T16:13:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T16:18:30.670116+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T16:18:30.670116+00:00","content_hash":"5c9a19482943de5a8470e1335ee22e15a36eb9847288afa591270a3c0d91b991","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}